{"id":"8264595767370","handle":"ruffle-crepe-long-sleeve-evening-dress-ee02833","title":"Ruffle Crepe Long Sleeve Evening Dress","descriptionHtml":"<p>Turn heads in this stunning evening dress! Featuring elegant ruffle details and a fitted crepe silhouette, this dress is designed to flatter your figure. The sophisticated sleeves add a touch of class, making it perfect for formal events or glamorous nights out.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><span>Tips:</span> Made of high-stretch fabric with at least 2 inches of stretch.</strong><br /><strong>Select your size based on the standard size chart.</strong><br /><strong>If there is a significant difference between your bust, waist, and hip measurements, prioritize the bust measurement when choosing.</strong><br /><strong>For a tighter fit, please choose one size smaller.</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Fit</b>: Please refer to size chart.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Length</b>: High low.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Sleeve Style</b>: Fitted sleeve.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Closure</b>: Back zipper.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Undergarments</b>: It is not padded, with lining.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fabric</b>:The garment comprises crepe.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Stretch</b>: Fabric is high stretch.</p>\n<p><br /></p>","type":"Evening Dresses","tags":["Black Tie","Bodycon","Crepe Dresses","Dresses","Evening Dresses & Gowns","Fall","Fitted Sleeve","Formal Dresses","High Low","Long Sleeve Dresses","measure","Mother-Of-The-Bride-Groom-dresses","New Arrivals","Ruffled","Slit","Spring","Summer","The Wedding Shop","V-Neck","Winters","With Sleeves"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.ever-pretty.com/products/ruffle-crepe-long-sleeve-evening-dress-ee02833","capturedAt":"2026-09-30T00:40:08.678Z","price":{"amount":82.99,"currency":"USD"},"compareAtPrice":null,"available":true,"options":["Color","Size"],"variants":[{"id":"43795041189962","sku":"EE02833BK04","color":"Black","size":"4","options":["Black","4"],"price":{"amount":82.99,"currency":"USD"